Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat: implement full multi-tenant auth and restaurant
 isolation
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Add Supabase Auth (email + password) via shared client in src/lib/supabase.js
- AuthContext provides session, restaurant data, signIn/signUp/signOut
- ProtectedRoute guards /admin/:restaurantId and redirects to /login
- New /register page: restaurant name, type, city, email, password → creates auth user + restaurant record with unique slug
- New /login page: email + password → redirects to /admin/:restaurantId
- Admin.jsx now reads restaurantId from URL params; all queries (pedidos, platos, realtime subscription) are scoped to that restaurantId; logout button added; header shows restaurant name/type/city
- Menu.jsx supports both /menu/:restaurantId/:tableId and /r/:restaurantId?mesa=N; fetches restaurant info dynamically from restaurants table; AI assistant prompt is dynamic per restaurant
- QR codes in Admin now point to /r/:restaurantId?mesa=N format
- Order.jsx and Gracias.jsx use shared supabase client

